# Git Branch Rules
- Do **not** create feature branches (`cursor/*`, `feat/*`, etc.).
- All work happens on the **`aqib`** branch. Commit and push to `origin/aqib` only.
- **`main`** is the integration branch; merge into `main` only when we explicitly decide to (PR or direct merge).

# Git Commit Rules
- NEVER add "Co-authored-by" tags to commit messages.
- NEVER add AI attribution (like "Generated with Cursor", "Co-authored-by: Cursor", or "Co-authored-by: cursoragent") to commits.
- Keep commit messages clean, professional, and strictly human-authored.
- Do not include any AI signatures or metadata in the git commit body.
